3. Not included

  Unlike the 0.4.x line, this version bundles no data derived from the Penn
  Treebank; the classic HMM probability tables were retired with the HMM
  engine. The 0.4.x releases remain available on RubyGems for users who
  need them (gem "engtagger", "~> 0.4").
